# The demonstrations themselves are a few hundred megabytes of rendered
# pictures, and demonstrations.py regenerates them from table numbers, so
# nothing is lost by leaving them out. What was collected is a measurement,
# so collected.json stays in.
demonstrations/**
!demonstrations/collected.json
demonstrations-check/**
!demonstrations-check/collected.json
videos/
__pycache__/

# The correction's own weights, which are large. Its recipe
# (adapter_config.json) and what the training did (training.json) stay in,
# because those are what a reader needs and they are small.
correction*/*.safetensors
correction*/*.bin
# The library writes a blank model card beside the adapter. training.json is
# the record that says anything.
correction*/README.md
